# This server's terms

_The default terms every Horse Drawing Tycoon 2 server starts with. Its operator's own additions, if any, follow._

This server is run by its operator - the person or people who look after it. They are not the Horse Drawing Tycoon 2 project, and the project does not run this server.

- **Your account lives here.** The operator holds your account and what you make on this server, and decides what it hosts and serves.
- **The operator may remove things.** They may remove content from this server, and suspend or remove accounts that break the Terms of Service above or this server's own rules.
- **No promises of service.** This server may go down, slow down, or close. Its operator offers no guarantee that it will keep running, or keep your data. Keep your own copies of anything that matters.
- **Moderation is by volunteers.** Reports reach the operator, who is under no obligation to answer them quickly - or at all. Block and hide work on your own devices at once.
- **These terms add to the application's.** Nothing here, or in the operator's additions, takes away from the Terms of Service above.
